  <StatCompression_AdvancedPreviewFormulaHigher>x = 属性值 / 基准值；h = 阈值；e = x - h&#10;x &lt;= h：结果 = 原值&#10;x &gt; h：结果 = 基准值 * (h + C(e))&#10;C(e) = {0}；实际 t = {1}</StatCompression_AdvancedPreviewFormulaHigher>
  <StatCompression_AdvancedPreviewFormulaLower>x = 属性值 / 基准值；r = 1 / x；h = 阈值；e = r - h&#10;r &lt;= h：结果 = 原值&#10;r &gt; h：结果 = 基准值 / (h + C(e))&#10;C(e) = {0}；实际 t = {1}</StatCompression_AdvancedPreviewFormulaLower>
